<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>About | StudentHub</title><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/theme.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/css/public.css?v=20260822"><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/public.js?v=20260822" defer></script></head><body class="public-page"><jsp:include page="partials/header.jsp"/><main><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container"><p class="eyebrow">Why StudentHub</p><h1>Built for better campus communication.</h1><p>One organized digital community for academic communication.</p></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="public-container"><div class="about-story"><article class="about-card large"><span class="role-label">THE PROBLEM</span><h2>Important information gets buried.</h2><p>Announcements, assignments, exam dates and academic information are often scattered inside Messenger and Viber group conversations, making them difficult to find when students need them.</p></article><article class="about-card large"><span class="role-label">OUR PURPOSE</span><h2>Bring academic communication together.</h2><p>StudentHub creates one organized digital community where relevant updates, deadlines and discussions remain clear and accessible.</p></article></div><div class="about-grid"><article class="about-card"><span class="card-icon">M</span><h2>Our Mission</h2><p>Make important academic information easier to find, follow and discuss.</p></article><article class="about-card"><span class="card-icon">D</span><h2>Designed For</h2><p>University Students<br>Class Representatives<br>Academic Communities</p></article><article class="about-card"><span class="card-icon">UIT</span><h2>University of Information Technology</h2><p>A student-focused platform shaped around an academic community.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="cta-section"><div class="public-container"><div class="cta-band"><h2>A smarter academic community starts here.</h2><a class="public-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get Started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section></main><jsp:include page="partials/footer.jsp"/></body></html>
